{
  "summary": "The experiment tested switching the RNA encoder from pca_n2000 to scvi_n200 in a multiprofile RNA-only model with avgpool aggregation, isolating the impact of encoder architecture. Validation accuracy improved to 0.650 (from 0.591 in config_002), suggesting the RNA encoder choice may influence performance. Uncertainty remains about whether this improvement reflects encoder-specific capabilities or other uncontrolled factors, and whether further changes to modalities or fusion strategies could yield additional gains."
}

